HELP=<<END
Merge three Git trees stored in CAOS without checking out source files.
Returns JSON containing tree (the merged tree ID) and conflicts (Git's native
report, empty when clean). Does not update conversation files or gitlinks.
@param merge-base Base tree ID
@param ours Current tree ID
@param theirs Incoming tree ID
END
curry --base:@=DEEP-DEPS/bash --worker1:@=worker.sh --help=$HELP
